{
    "boxes": [
        {
            "text": "Does the material in question constitute exactly the same content as the original release in the country of origin?",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 25,
            "y_step": 25,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "No",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 320,
            "y_step": 125,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Are the differences minor?",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 25,
            "y_step": 175,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Catalogue material as VARIANT of original work",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 25,
            "y_step": 225,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Minor changes in performers/performance",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 175,
            "y_step": 290,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Removal/replacement/addition of some but not most contributors",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 300,
            "y_step": 355,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Examples \n- Changes to crew/cast related to different language versions. \n- Changes to crew/cast related to restorations/preservations.",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 300,
            "y_step": 420,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Minor changes in footage or continuity",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 175,
            "y_step": 535,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Editing differences including footage or continuity changes from original work.",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 300,
            "y_step": 600,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Examples \n- Rules of the Game \n- Blade Runner (1982/2007) \n- Mr. Arkadin (1955/1956)",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 300,
            "y_step": 680,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Edits of work for reasons of duration/censorship/augmentation etc",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 300,
            "y_step": 780,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Examples \n- Television or airline versions of works edited for duration, language, content, etc \n- Preservation/restoration/ alternate ending versions.",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 300,
            "y_step": 860,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Minor changes in textual aspect",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 175,
            "y_step": 990,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Changes/additions/removal of some dialogue, narration, audio or text",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 300,
            "y_step": 1040,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Examples \n- Addition/removal of explanatory text, dubbing, subtitles etc. \n- Star Wars Episode 2 (2002) (dubbed into 19 languages). \n- Sonorized versions of silent films: \n- Cabirira (1914/1931)",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 300,
            "y_step": 1110,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Subtitles/dubbing etc of same textual content into different languages",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 300,
            "y_step": 1270,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Example \n- Deep Impact (1998, EnglishDialogue)/Impacto Profundo (1998, Portuguese dialogue, Spanish subtitles)",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 300,
            "y_step": 1355,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Are the differences major?",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 450,
            "y_step": 175,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Catalogue material as NEW WORK",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 450,
            "y_step": 225,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Major changes in performers/performance",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 600,
            "y_step": 290,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Each filming of a performance-based work",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 740,
            "y_step": 355,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Example \n- Filmed stage performances of Macbeth or Hamlet",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 740,
            "y_step": 420,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Removal/replacement of most contributors",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 740,
            "y_step": 490,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Example \n- Chickens Come Home (1931)",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 740,
            "y_step": 550,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Major changes in footage or continuity",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 600,
            "y_step": 620,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Remakes of the same story/plot",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 740,
            "y_step": 680,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Examples \n- Planet of the Apes (1968/2001) \n- Scarface (1932/1983) \n- The Man Who Knew Too Much(1934/1956)",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 740,
            "y_step": 730,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Different language versions shot at the same time",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 740,
            "y_step": 840,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Examples \n- Dracula (1931): English and Spanish \n- Anna Christie (1930/1931): English and German",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 740,
            "y_step": 900,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Major changes in textual aspect",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
            "x_step": 600,
            "y_step": 1020,
            "interval": 15,
            "padding": 10
        },
        {
            "text": "Complete change of dialogue or narration to an existing work",
            "weight": "Light",
            "size": 15,
